# Silver Sable, Mercenary Leader: a creature is modified by an Aura only if its controller controls the Aura (CR 700.9). Bot2 puts its
# Rancor on Bot1's Ornithopter on turn 2 (it has trample, but is not modified). Sable's enters trigger puts its counter on Bot2's
# Ornithopter on turn 3. When Sable attacks, Bot1 controls no modified creature, so the ability has no legal target and is removed from
# the stack (CR 603.3d): no creature of Bot1's gains lifelink.

[Bot1 Deck]
Silver Sable, Mercenary Leader
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Rancor
Mox Emerald
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Rancor.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Silver Sable, Mercenary Leader.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Silver Sable, Mercenary Leader > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Trample
Bot1.Battlefield.Silver Sable, Mercenary Leader.Keywords = (absent)
Stack.Count = 0
